// Placeholder values, committed so `xcodegen generate` works out of the
// box (project.yml references this file unconditionally). Safe as-is:
// AppEnvironment.localOnly() - the default in ReceiptVaultApp.swift right
// now - never reads these. Replace with a real Supabase project's values
// only when you switch to AppEnvironment.live(); see SETUP.md.
//
// SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the public/anon key, not the service-role key - it
// is safe to ship inside the app bundle because every table it can reach
// is protected by Row Level Security (see supabase/migrations/). Never put
// a service-role key here or anywhere in the app target (spec 7.2, 14.1).
SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/placeholder.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = placeholder-anon-key
